              <h2>3 Quick Pre-Flight Checklist Tips for Parents</h2>
              <ol>
                <li><strong>Test in Airplane Mode the Night Before:</strong> Turn on Airplane Mode at home and open
                  every app on your child's tablet for 10 seconds. If an app asks to verify a subscription or download
                  extra assets, do it on home Wi-Fi rather than at the boarding gate!</li>
                <li><strong>Prefer One-Time Purchases for Travel Tablets:</strong> If your family only uses a tablet a
                  few times a year for vacations, apps with a <strong>one-time unlock</strong> (like <strong><a
                      href="/discovery/">Kidamame Discovery</a></strong>) never lock you out due to an expired monthly
                  subscription mid-flight.</li>
                <li><strong>Switch Languages Together on International Trips:</strong> Travelling to Italy, France,
                  Spain, Germany, or Portugal? Switch the language inside Kidamame Discovery to read wildlife facts in
                  the local language of your destination!</li>
